{{suffix|French|man|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|Frenchmen}}

# A man of [[French]] [[birth]] or [[nationality]].
# A [[home-made]] [[tool]] used by [[bricklayer]]s to cut excess [[mortar]] from newly pointed [[brickwork]].
# {{label|en|UK}} The [[red-legged partridge]].

